note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note life[2*v] is first_def, life[2*v+1] is last_use (signed C interval indices).
note Extending after replay is equivalent to extending at each closing BRA: a later use already dominates that end.
fn lifext life edit ulong 512 n ulong s long e long to void
for v ulong n
b = mul v 2
fd = long get life b
lu = long get life add b 1
if and ge fd 0 and lt fd s and ge lu s lt lu e
put life add b 1 ulong e
end
end
end
fn lifhint life edit ulong 512 n ulong v ulong h ulong to ulong
if eq h 0
ret 0
end
b = mul v 2
fd = long get life b
lu = long get life add b 1
if or lt fd 0 or lt h ulong fd or lt h ulong lu ge h n
ret 10
end
put life add b 1 h
ret 0
end
fn cg_life meta view ulong 512 life edit ulong 512 to ulong
for l ulong get meta 5
s = long int get meta add 16 mul l 2
e = long int get meta add 17 mul l 2
lifext life get meta 1 s e
end
if eq get meta 7 0
ret 0
end
for v ulong get meta 1
if ne lifhint life get meta 0 v get meta add 352 v 0
ret 10
end
end
ret 0
end
